{"title": "referer 落日志：来源原样入库", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "log_format ref '$status \"$http_referer\"';"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "access_log /var/log/nginx/ref.log ref;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -H 'Referer: https://yourwebsite.com' localhost"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -H 'Referer: https://evil.example/hotlink' localhost"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "tail -2 /var/log/nginx/ref.log"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "200 \"https://yourwebsite.com\""},
  {"t": "out", "s": "403 \"https://evil.example/hotlink\""},
  {"t": "note", "s": "合法来源与盗链来源各留一行，统计审计都有据可查"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
